--- !u!114 &138455725
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 138455723}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Scroll through these instructions with the left stick\nWhen ready use
    the left finger trigger to close me!\n\nBuild Instructions\n\n1. Time to Craft
    a Climb! Use Left Controller's Trigger to grab and place boulders from the table
    to the wall. \n\n2. Place your star on your wall, this is your final hold that
    you must touch to win the game!\n\n3. In front of you, observe the Control Panel.\n\nOn
    the left side of the Panel, you can adjust the properties of boulders to place.\na.
    Use slider to adjust the boulder size.\nb. Use dial to adjust the boulder rotation
    angles.\nc. Use switch to adjust whether a boulder will move in game.\n\nOn the
    right side of the Panel, you can adjust the game settings.\nc. Use switch to
    turn on falling boulders in-game. If you get hit by a boulder, you lose your
    grip!\nd. Use switch to turn the stamina system on or off.\n\n3. Touch the garbage
    can to clear your wall and start your build over.\n\n4. When you're done your
    craft, press the red button to play!\n\n\nClimbing Instructions\n\n1. To move
    across the wall, use the right thumbstick across the blue mat and teleport. \n\n2.
    To climb a boulder, grip on the boulder and pull up. Use both hands to climb
    the wall!\n\n3. On falling boulders mode, watch out for falling boulders. If
    a boulder hits you, you'll lose stamina!\n\n4. With stamina on, you can't hold
    onto a boulder for too long. Think fast and watch your stamina indicator! You
    can get a boost by applying chalk!\n\n5. To win the game, touch the rotating
    star in your crafted climb! \n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
